cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AeroMargin, please cite it and the datasets it builds on."
title: "AeroMargin: safe walking routes on Mars terrain with an oxygen margin for the way home"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Team Cheese Pizza"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yeapbaz-ui/aeromargin"
url: "https://yeapbaz-ui.github.io/aeromargin/"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
version: "1.2.0"
abstract: "Static web demo for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026. Real elevation data for Melas Chasma (USGS HRSC and MOLA blended DEM) with a team model of walking cost, oxygen use and the point of no return. Not an official NASA product."
